From: GibaxLeGrand <48137851+GibaxLeGrand@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:21:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Runner: the lobby on the waiting screen, experimental
 (SRNP_LOBBY=1)

HELLO ... LOBBY: the seat chooses before it is ready. On the waiting screen the local pad (manette mode)
picks the character (left/right, Super Sonic left out) and the gear (up/down), A is ready; PICK and
READY go to the relay, whose PICKS set every seat's choice (heads on the waiting screen, the race's
characters). SRNP_LOBBY_AUTO=<c>/<g>/<s> chooses alone (tests). The relay is read every 16 ms between
the choices (LineReady). Measured: 3 runners choosing Knuckles, Rouge and NiGHTS alone, GO once all
were ready, the race with those characters, 26 checksums equal. Not yet: B back to choosing, the
gear's name, the host's settings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/runtime/srnp_relay.cpp | 131 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 129 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

